<html xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" xmlns:w="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<title>Beslispunt</title>
<style>
@page { size: A4; margin: 1.8cm; }
body { font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; color: #111827; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.35; }
h1 { color: #1D4ED8; font-size: 22pt; margin: 0 0 4pt; }
h2 { color: #1D4ED8; font-size: 14pt; margin: 16pt 0 6pt; }
.lede { color: #6B7280; margin-bottom: 14pt; }
table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 0 0 12pt; }
th { background: #1D4ED8; color: #fff; text-align: left; padding: 6px 8px; font-weight: 600; }
td { border: 1px solid #D1D5DB; padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; }
.meta td:nth-child(odd) { background: #F3F4F6; font-weight: 600; width: 22%; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Beslispunt</h1>
<p class="lede">Invultemplate voor de fasepoort.</p>
<table class="meta">
<tr><td>Project</td><td></td><td>Fase</td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>Datum</td><td></td><td>Voorzitter</td><td>Opdrachtgever</td></tr>
</table>
<h2>1. Vraag</h2>
<p>Ga / nader uitwerken / stoppen. Onderbouw met scope, tijd, geld en risico.</p>
<h2>2. Ter besluitvorming</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Onderwerp</th><th>Advies</th><th>Gevolg bij ja</th><th>Gevolg bij nee</th></tr>
<tr><td>Doorgaan naar volgende fase</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>Baseline vastzetten</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
</table>
<h2>3. Stand tegenover de baseline</h2>
<table>
<tr><th></th><th>Baseline</th><th>Actueel</th><th>Verschil</th></tr>
<tr><td>Einddatum</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>Budget</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>Scope</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
</table>
<h2>4. Besluit</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Keuze</th><th>Toelichting</th><th>Naam</th><th>Datum</th></tr>
<tr><td>Ga</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>Nader uitwerken</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>Stoppen</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
</table>
</body></html>
